---

<section class="how-it-works" id="how-it-works">
  <div class="section-header">
    <h2>Three taps. That's it.</h2>
    <p>No setup, no configuration, no learning curve.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="steps-row">
    <div class="step-item">
      <div class="step-number">1</div>
      <h3>Type your task</h3>
      <p>
        Write whatever is on your mind. "Do laundry," "apply for jobs," "clean
        the garage" — messy is fine. We don't judge.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="connector">
      <svg width="40" height="2" viewBox="0 0 40 2">
        <line x1="0" y1="1" x2="40" y2="1" stroke="#d6d3d1" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="step-item">
      <div class="step-number">2</div>
      <h3>AI breaks it down</h3>
      <p>
        Claude AI turns your task into 5&ndash;15 concrete micro-steps. Each one
        starts with a verb and takes under 2 minutes.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="connector">
      <svg width="40" height="2" viewBox="0 0 40 2">
        <line x1="0" y1="1" x2="40" y2="1" stroke="#d6d3d1" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 4" />
      </svg>
    </div>

    <div class="step-item">
      <div class="step-number">3</div>
      <h3>Tap through each step</h3>
      <p>
        One step on screen at a time. Hit "Done" and move on. Watch the progress
        bar fill up. Celebrate when you finish.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how-it-works {
    max-width: 1120px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
  }

  .section-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }

  .section-header h2 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--stone-900);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .section-header p {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    color: var(--stone-500);
  }

  .steps-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .step-item {
    flex: 1;
    max-width: 300px;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .step-number {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 3rem;
    height: 3rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--amber-500);
    color: white;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .step-item h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--stone-800);
    margin-bottom: 0.625rem;
  }

  .step-item p {
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    color: var(--stone-500);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .connector {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .steps-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .connector {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
      padding-top: 0;
    }

    .step-item {
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  }
</style>
